{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/extras/8b66d09013c01ac7605c482c689a40f3.avif?t=1765316056\" width=1460 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build, rotate and destroy hexagons.<br>Build colored hexagons to unlock more of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/extras/c76e211a2b8b394fbb79f266c89edc71.poster.avif?t=1765316056\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/extras/c76e211a2b8b394fbb79f266c89edc71.webm?t=1765316056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start building your Skill Tree!<br>Rebuild your skill tree whenever you want.<br>Use newly unlocked hexagons to reach different skills at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/extras/64c94b5d6ddbe1a67487f758855a3b33.poster.avif?t=1765316056\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/extras/64c94b5d6ddbe1a67487f758855a3b33.webm?t=1765316056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Level up your skills to strengthen your marbles,<br>The stronger they are the further they can go.<br>Explore outskirts of the map, <br>and create the most\u00a0beautiful mandala you can think of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/extras/8b66d09013c01ac7605c482c689a40f3.avif?t=1765316056\" width=1460 height=90 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922900?t=1765316056","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922900?t=1765316056","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/fdb0dcf6cd7347bbab98cd9e4199429993506ad5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765316056","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/fdb0dcf6cd7347bbab98cd9e4199429993506ad5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765316056","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/extras/8b66d09013c01ac7605c482c689a40f3.avif?t=1765316056\" width=1460 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build, rotate and destroy hexagons.<br>Build colored hexagons to unlock more of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/extras/c76e211a2b8b394fbb79f266c89edc71.poster.avif?t=1765316056\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922900/extras/c76e211a2b8b394fbb79f266c89edc71.webm?t=1765316056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start building your Skill Tree!<br>Rebuild your skill tree whene